---
description: Frontend JS/HTML conventions for eQuotation
globs: "static/**/*.js,templates/**/*.html"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Frontend

- Do not add new inline `<script>` blocks in templates. Put JS in `static/js/` (or `static/js/procurement/`).
- Use shared helpers from `static/js/eq_core.js` (`escapeHtml`, `formatMoney`, `formatDate`, `fetchJson`). Do not redefine them.
- HTML-building functions stay under ~80 lines; split large template literals into smaller helpers.
- No nested ternaries inside template literals — use a named helper or early `if`.
- Prefer `async/await` over deep `.then()` chains.
- Keep CSS in `static/css/`; do not nest large `<style>` blocks inside DOM markup.
